    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d606">

                <pb facs="0746" n="658" xml:id="pg658"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Pearson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi><lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-03-23"><hi rendition="#italic">March 23,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Insist on energetic action by Persian authorities to apprehend and punish
                    murderer of Labaree, and urge efficient protection of all American missionaries.
                    Keep Department advised.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
